  message: "v6.0.0 security arc progress: PR5 COMPLETE (WI-razol done) via #4145 + #4147. The taint sink/source matcher (match_sink) and — the real cascade codepath — propagation (propagate_taint_structural/_ddg) now honor the module qualifier + ambiguous_names, mirroring io-boundaries. End-to-end self-claims violated evidence dropped 5975->1266 (replace/write cascades eliminated; 2 claims flipped to confirmed); residual is dominated by genuine subprocess.run/shutil.copy true positives plus a small 'copy'-not-ambiguous catalog gap (filed INV-mivud P3, non-blocking). Lesson re-confirmed: the unit fix (#4145) was inert until an end-to-end repro proved it; #4147 fixed the actual path. 5 of 6 arc PRs done. Remaining: PR6 INV-hukug (claims-file-extras vs CLI-extras taint-layer reification; cli.py ~4431 + taint.py _merge_with_user_override). Then re-verify METAs and cut v6.0.0."  # a4db
